Brain model

The brain view draws a model that is adapted from the 3D Reference Organ for Brain, Male, version 1.4, of the HuBMAP
Human Reference Atlas.

Citation: Browne, Kristen, and Heidi Schlehlein. 2024. 3D Reference Organ for Brain, Male v1.4.
https://doi.org/10.48539/HBM538.NKCT.649
Source: https://cdn.humanatlas.io/digital-objects/ref-organ/brain-male/v1.4/assets/3d-allen-m-brain.glb
Derived from: Ding et al. 2016, Comprehensive Cellular-Resolution Atlas of the Adult Human Brain, Journal of Comparative
Neurology 524(16):3127-3481 (Allen Human Brain Atlas).
Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Changes: Ranviera simplified the meshes, grouped them into regions, re-centred and rescaled them, mirrored them to true
handedness (the X axis is negated so that the left hemisphere lies at positive X), and recoloured them.

The files brain.glb, brain-points.bin and brain-regions.json in web/public/brain are adapted material under that licence.
The licence of the model applies to those files and not to the rest of the product.

